@page "/FailurePolicy/ChangedSubdirectory/Page"

<h1>Changed Subdirectory Page</h1>
<p>
    You can't see this page because while FailurePolicy/ChangedSubdirectory adds <code>@Policy.SuccessPolicy</code> (which would usually give us access), the <code>_Imports.razor</code> declaration in
    the FailurePolicy folder is <i>additive</i>, meaning that we must pass both <code>@Policy.SuccessPolicy</code> <i>and</i> <code>@Policy.FailurePolicy</code>, which is impossible!
</p>